  {"image": "side2", "label": "PROG2", "place": {"file": "PROG2", "type": "PRG", "track": 16, "sector": 0}, "load": "$0B00", "bytes": 26928, "sha256": "3f27d4feaf7b379af40c6239b2dfa0c4673fdfd0243db576f1d0b9c196b27c18", "answer": "part", "part": "judo", "at": "$0B00", "why": "Psychic Judo, the event file. 20,841 of its 26,928 bytes are the same in the snapshot; most of the rest is $0B01-$1C0E, where the event builds its depth table at the start over what the file holds, and the screen, sprite and sound work areas it rewrites as it plays."},
